# Allowlist build context: exclude everything, then add only what the build needs.
*

!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!scripts/
!tsconfig.build.json
!src/
!web/
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!licenses/
!deploy/config.json

# Tests, local data and caches inside allowed directories never enter the image.
**/*.test.ts
**/node_modules
**/.wa-chatgpt
**/state.json
**/creds.json
**/bridge.lock
**/onboarding.json*
**/.*.config.tmp
**/server-token*
**/.env*
**/.DS_Store
